CONTENT PACK   (= one repeatable content series the social team executes)
│
├── 1. OVERVIEW                         [what this series is, at a glance]
│   ├── 1.1 Series Name + Premise        the named franchise + its one-line hook concept
│   ├── 1.2 Format & Platform            reel / carousel / etc. + where it runs
│   └── 1.3 Origin                       the competitor insight / whitespace / pillar it came from
│                                        (the bridge back to the competitor packs)
│
├── 2. STRATEGY                         [why we're making it — kept deliberately light]
│   ├── 2.1 What It Promotes             the product angle / feature this series sells
│   ├── 2.2 Goal                         awareness / engagement / conversion
│   └── 2.3 Who It's For                 target viewer
│
├── 3. THE SERIES  →  WHAT TO MAKE      [the actual content plan — the core]
│   └── (per episode)
│       ├── 3.x.1 Title / Angle          the specific idea for this installment
│       ├── 3.x.2 Hook                    the opening line or visual
│       ├── 3.x.3 What It Shows           the beat-by-beat of the episode
│       └── 3.x.4 CTA                      what the viewer should do after
│
├── 4. THE RECIPE  →  HOW TO MAKE       [the reusable template for ANY episode]
│   ├── 4.1 Structure                    hook → body → CTA skeleton + target length
│   ├── 4.2 Visual Style                 shot types, on-screen text, overall look
│   ├── 4.3 Audio                        music / voiceover / trend-sound approach
│   └── 4.4 Caption + Hashtags           the fill-in template + tag set
│
└── 5. EXECUTION                        [running it — kept light]
    ├── 5.1 Cadence                      how often an episode ships
    ├── 5.2 Roles & Effort               who does what, rough difficulty
    └── 5.3 What Good Looks Like         the signal to watch (a light metric, not a report)